# E10 bridge: Lean data and challenge statements (statement writer, 2026-10-20)

Statements only; no proofs (the two theorems end in `sorry`).

## Files
- `formal/Formal/Claude5E10Spec.lean` — `e10Cell`, `e10Lab`, `e10Poly`, `e10Sig`, `e10Graph` in
  namespace `Claude2Aligned`. Compiles.
- `formal/Formal/Claude5E10ComparatorChallenge.lean` (copy: `ChallengeE10.lean`) — Mathlib-only
